# Modifying HTTP request with Burp proxy

## Objective

Intercept request and modify it to alter outcome

## Skills Used

- Burp Suite Proxy

## Process

1. Intercepted traffic.
2. Identified reflected body parameter.
3. Altered price of item
4. Confirmed execution.

## What I Learned

I learned how to intercept, review, and manipulate HTTP traffic using Burp Proxy. I was able to alter the price of an item (from $1337 to 7 cents)in a shopping cart and proceed to order.
